/datum/job/roguetown/hand
	tutorial = "You owe everything to your liege. Once, you were just a humble friend--now you are one of the most important people within the county itself. You have played spymaster and confidant to the Noble-Family for so long that you are a veritable vault of intrigue, something you exploit with potent conviction at every opportunity. Let no man ever forget into whose ear you whisper. You've killed more men with those lips than any blademaster could ever claim to."

/datum/job/roguetown/magician
	tutorial = "Your creed is one dedicated to the conquering of the arcane arts and the constant thrill of knowledge. \
		You owe your life to the Lord, for it was his coin that allowed you to continue your studies in these dark times. \
		In return, you have proven time and time again as justicar and trusted advisor to their reign. You operate \
		within the University-Under-the-Scar, sharing authority jointly with the Head Physician; their realm is the study \
		of the mundane body, whereas you have authority over all things arcane."

